WEBVTT

01:13.800 --> 01:19.080
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.800 --> 01:21.080
[Episode 09]

01:27.667 --> 01:30.893
Knowing you know nothing

01:30.917 --> 01:32.437
is the beginning of wisdom.

01:34.077 --> 01:35.083
Knowing what?

01:35.107 --> 01:36.587
Your words make me painful.

01:38.277 --> 01:40.437
I recently wrote a new song.

01:42.357 --> 01:44.917
Lonely men.

01:47.947 --> 01:48.973
Damai.

01:48.997 --> 01:50.307
Do you want to listen to it?

01:57.077 --> 01:58.077
All right.

01:58.747 --> 02:00.437
OK, I'll sing to you.

02:01.467 --> 02:02.517
Hu.

02:03.117 --> 02:05.413
Let's sing All Right together.

02:05.437 --> 02:06.163
All Right.

02:06.187 --> 02:07.133
All Right.

02:07.157 --> 02:08.397
Okay.

02:10.277 --> 02:11.253
All Right.

02:11.277 --> 02:12.277
All Right.

02:17.027 --> 02:18.067
Here it comes.

02:34.747 --> 02:39.147
♫ Do you have the same feeling ♫

02:39.967 --> 02:42.827
♫ The more bustling ♫

02:42.907 --> 02:45.047
♫ The more lonely ♫

02:45.587 --> 02:50.267
♫ We lost it with no turning back ♫

02:51.267 --> 02:53.747
♫ Do you still care about it ♫

02:54.307 --> 02:56.367
♫ Do you still care about it♫

02:57.407 --> 03:02.007
♫ It's a long way to go♫

03:03.247 --> 03:08.007
♫ Don't stay in the past ♫

03:09.007 --> 03:12.847
♫ You ask me about what I've given up ♫

03:13.507 --> 03:15.827
♫ The closer ♫

03:16.487 --> 03:18.767
♫ The more unfamiliar ♫

03:22.767 --> 03:25.047
♫ I start to understand it when we meet again ♫

03:27.987 --> 03:30.027
♫ It's the unyielding you ♫

03:30.887 --> 03:32.967
♫ It's the unyielding you ♫

03:33.927 --> 03:37.447
♫ The answer I didn't tell you ♫

03:39.567 --> 03:43.627
♫ I know what you care ♫

03:44.647 --> 03:48.107
♫ How much you can't let it go ♫

03:49.907 --> 03:52.027
♫ I know it all ♫

03:52.567 --> 03:54.847
♫ I know it all ♫

03:55.387 --> 03:59.247
♫ We never let it go ♫

04:00.947 --> 04:04.907
♫ Hope you forgive the stupidness in the past ♫

04:07.487 --> 04:09.767
♫ It's all right ♫

04:10.487 --> 04:12.927
♫ It'll be all right ♫

04:16.647 --> 04:20.787
♫ I start to understand it when we meet again ♫

04:22.287 --> 04:24.567
♫ It's the unyielding you ♫

04:25.047 --> 04:27.327
♫ It's the unyielding you ♫

04:42.527 --> 04:47.147
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

04:49.997 --> 04:50.997
Nanxing.

04:59.557 --> 05:00.557
Nanxing.

05:04.187 --> 05:09.467
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

05:12.847 --> 05:17.127
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

05:19.487 --> 05:24.267
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

05:26.667 --> 05:31.447
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

05:34.037 --> 05:35.107
Hongdou.

05:36.357 --> 05:37.267
This wind really

05:37.267 --> 05:38.987
comes from all directions.

05:39.747 --> 05:41.077
It's random.

05:41.367 --> 05:48.127
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

05:48.347 --> 05:53.467
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

05:56.367 --> 05:58.307
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

05:58.307 --> 06:02.707
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

06:02.887 --> 06:08.907
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

06:12.597 --> 06:14.013
Lil Cute ate it.

06:14.037 --> 06:15.093
Lil Cute ate it.

06:15.117 --> 06:15.557
Lil Cute.

06:15.557 --> 06:17.363
This cucumber is very delicious.

06:17.387 --> 06:17.917
Lil Cute.

06:17.917 --> 06:19.707
This spicy gluten is very tasty.

06:19.707 --> 06:21.277
And chocolate.

06:21.387 --> 06:23.043
Lil Cute is poor.

06:23.067 --> 06:24.667
We have so much delicious food.

06:24.707 --> 06:27.277
Uncle Yao only feeds it with grass.

06:27.827 --> 06:29.637
He's so annoying.

06:31.627 --> 06:33.317
Why am I annoying?

06:35.267 --> 06:36.957
What are you feeding Lil Cute?

06:37.147 --> 06:38.093
Run, now.

06:38.117 --> 06:39.597
Help, help me.

06:39.597 --> 06:40.283
Got one.

06:40.307 --> 06:41.067
Leave me alone.

06:41.067 --> 06:42.237
I'm not gonna die.

06:42.237 --> 06:43.243
Run now.

06:43.267 --> 06:43.597
Run fast.

06:43.597 --> 06:44.483
Run.

06:44.507 --> 06:45.603
Run.

06:45.627 --> 06:47.227
Go now.

06:48.707 --> 06:49.923
Apples are okay.

06:49.947 --> 06:51.107
Cucumbers are also okay.

06:51.237 --> 06:53.077
You can't feed it spicy gluten and chocolates.

06:53.307 --> 06:54.507
Do you know it will

06:54.507 --> 06:55.307
have a stomachache

06:55.307 --> 06:56.243
if it eats them?

06:56.267 --> 06:58.387
But the last time I fed it roasted eggplants

06:58.387 --> 06:59.757
and it was okay.

07:02.387 --> 07:04.517
When was that?

07:09.917 --> 07:11.827
The rice noodles cooked by Uncle Yao

07:11.827 --> 07:13.013
are so delicious,

07:13.037 --> 07:14.467
right?

07:14.507 --> 07:15.557
Yes.

07:15.557 --> 07:17.587
Delicious.

07:27.037 --> 07:28.123
Yeah.

07:28.147 --> 07:29.197
Delicious.

07:39.557 --> 07:40.413
Nana.

07:40.437 --> 07:41.093
Why?

07:41.117 --> 07:43.027
You don't have many customers here.

07:43.147 --> 07:45.317
Why did you ask me to be a volunteer?

07:45.357 --> 07:46.787
I'm a guest.

07:47.707 --> 07:48.923
Hongdou.

07:48.947 --> 07:51.837
Just staying here is boring.

07:52.827 --> 07:54.603
How about working with me?

07:54.627 --> 07:55.667
Your meals are on me.

07:58.067 --> 07:59.227
I'm not bored.

07:59.267 --> 08:00.717
I'm here to have a rest.

08:00.947 --> 08:02.107
Reading now.

08:02.557 --> 08:03.973
I saw it.

08:03.997 --> 08:05.147
You just read for a while

08:05.147 --> 08:06.757
then started browsing on your phone.

08:06.827 --> 08:08.357
Hot news, right?

08:08.357 --> 08:10.317
You've got a bad mood.

08:10.947 --> 08:11.877
Tell me the truth,

08:11.877 --> 08:12.677
do you really want to

08:12.677 --> 08:14.107
wander around for three months?

08:15.147 --> 08:16.587
I'm not wandering.

08:17.067 --> 08:18.637
I'm either sitting or lying down.

08:19.597 --> 08:20.627
Who told me

08:20.627 --> 08:22.347
life lies in movement?

08:22.597 --> 08:24.347
Life lies in movement,

08:24.597 --> 08:26.237
not work.

08:26.547 --> 08:27.627
But volunteering

08:27.627 --> 08:28.933
is also a kind of rest.

08:28.957 --> 08:30.427
That's different.

08:30.547 --> 08:33.357
A volunteer is a job that doesn't get paid.

08:34.027 --> 08:37.027
Work and rest are different.

08:37.427 --> 08:37.997
Don't lie to me

08:37.997 --> 08:40.597
with the verbal tricks of capitalists.

08:42.427 --> 08:43.197
Why can't Xiaochun

08:43.197 --> 08:44.357
find someone else to help her?

08:44.477 --> 08:46.077
We have enough hands in the shop.

08:46.077 --> 08:46.837
I'm here.

08:46.837 --> 08:48.357
Granny Xiuying, Granny Caiyun.

08:48.357 --> 08:49.667
Xiaochun will come and help

08:49.667 --> 08:51.707
when she's done with her work.

08:53.547 --> 08:55.477
Grannies are mascots.

08:57.837 --> 09:00.477
They are the faces of our shop.

09:01.547 --> 09:03.077
A volunteer just needs to stay here

09:03.077 --> 09:03.723
when it's busy.

09:03.747 --> 09:05.597
You have your free time.

09:06.877 --> 09:09.187
Why do you persuade me to be a volunteer?

09:10.997 --> 09:11.997
I'm just...

09:12.317 --> 09:13.317
asking you.

09:19.077 --> 09:19.717
Why?

09:19.717 --> 09:20.643
Hongdou.

09:20.667 --> 09:22.187
Has the customer there left?

09:22.597 --> 09:23.877
Yes. For a while.

09:28.667 --> 09:30.403
Again, forget to pay the bill.

09:30.427 --> 09:32.117
Once or twice a month.

09:32.197 --> 09:33.197
Let me see.

09:39.237 --> 09:40.237
I'll go to find them.

09:40.627 --> 09:41.813
Where are you going?

09:41.837 --> 09:42.837
The town entrance.

09:47.387 --> 09:49.003
Sister Hongdou.

09:49.027 --> 09:50.517
She runs so fast,

09:50.547 --> 09:52.077
for what?

09:52.077 --> 09:52.883
I don't know.

09:52.907 --> 09:53.483
Go after her.

09:53.507 --> 09:54.507
Go.

09:55.747 --> 10:00.007
♫ Guests go to the homeland
of the Bai Minority ♫

10:00.007 --> 10:01.847
♫ The Bai people are happy to welcome them ♫

10:01.847 --> 10:03.747
♫ With Bai wine ♫

10:03.747 --> 10:05.997
It's Hulu.

10:05.997 --> 10:07.547
They're chasing the aunt.

10:07.547 --> 10:08.323
Go.

10:08.347 --> 10:11.147
♫ The first toast for health ♫

10:11.567 --> 10:14.847
♫ The second toast for work ♫

10:16.967 --> 10:20.147
♫ The third toast for friendship ♫

10:20.187 --> 10:21.477
Excuse me, wait a minute.

10:26.267 --> 10:27.213
What's wrong?

10:27.237 --> 10:28.397
You forgot to pay the bill.

10:28.427 --> 10:29.547
Didn't you pay the bill?

10:29.667 --> 10:30.707
I forgot about it.

10:30.957 --> 10:31.837
Sorry for that.

10:31.837 --> 10:32.453
How much?

10:32.477 --> 10:33.707
207 yuan.

10:33.747 --> 10:34.093
Okay.

10:34.117 --> 10:35.117
Scan this.

10:44.907 --> 10:46.067
It's done.

10:50.027 --> 10:51.397
Why are you chasing me?

10:51.627 --> 10:52.643
Sister Hongdou.

10:52.667 --> 10:54.123
How come you run so fast?

10:54.147 --> 10:55.237
I've never seen

10:55.237 --> 10:56.597
you run so fast before.

10:59.197 --> 11:00.427
I'm exhausted.

11:01.477 --> 11:02.117
Xu Hongdou.

11:02.117 --> 11:03.477
Don't run so fast next time.

11:03.477 --> 11:04.787
Sister Hongdou.

11:10.627 --> 11:11.317
Come on.

11:11.317 --> 11:12.027
It's for everyone.

11:12.027 --> 11:12.717
Don't worry. Here.

11:12.717 --> 11:14.547
Uncle, I want a cream one.

11:14.547 --> 11:15.747
Cream? Okay.

11:15.747 --> 11:16.197
Okay.

11:16.197 --> 11:17.003
Who hasn't had it?

11:17.027 --> 11:18.237
For everyone.

11:18.667 --> 11:18.957
Who else?

11:18.957 --> 11:19.237
Thanks.

11:19.237 --> 11:19.883
Here.

11:19.907 --> 11:20.723
Thanks, Uncle Yao.

11:20.747 --> 11:21.787
One for all.

11:22.317 --> 11:23.213
Does every one of you have it?

11:23.237 --> 11:24.197
Go home now.

11:24.197 --> 11:25.427
Just go.

11:25.907 --> 11:26.507
Stay safe.

11:26.507 --> 11:28.027
Goodbye, Granny.

11:28.027 --> 11:28.317
Bye.

11:28.317 --> 11:28.837
Goodbye.

11:28.837 --> 11:30.117
Watch out when crossing the street,

11:30.117 --> 11:30.667
remember?

11:30.667 --> 11:31.747
Goodbye, Granny.

11:31.747 --> 11:32.957
Bye.

11:32.957 --> 11:33.747
Goodbye, Granny.

11:33.747 --> 11:34.547
Goodbye.

11:34.547 --> 11:35.643
Goodbye, Granny.

11:35.667 --> 11:37.187
I see.

11:37.357 --> 11:38.237
Walk slowly.

11:38.237 --> 11:39.213
Granny, Granny.

11:39.237 --> 11:40.237
Jujube juice.

11:40.477 --> 11:40.997
For you, too.

11:40.997 --> 11:41.997
Thank you.

11:43.317 --> 11:44.667
Good for you.

11:44.877 --> 11:46.267
There are roads in all directions.

11:46.267 --> 11:47.523
You really got it.

11:47.547 --> 11:48.267
I see them

11:48.267 --> 11:49.757
with a lot of things in hands.

11:49.957 --> 11:50.547
I guess

11:50.547 --> 11:52.357
they'll take a taxi at the town entrance.

11:53.317 --> 11:54.027
It's my experience

11:54.027 --> 11:56.027
of service over the past 10 years.

11:56.427 --> 11:58.387
The biggest trouble in the cafe is

11:58.387 --> 11:59.637
those guests forgetting to pay their bills.

12:00.197 --> 12:01.523
We've faced more troubles

12:01.547 --> 12:03.427
and complex situations

12:03.427 --> 12:04.517
in the hotel industry.

12:08.747 --> 12:09.693
Granny.

12:09.717 --> 12:10.603
Let me.

12:10.627 --> 12:11.627
I'll take it.

12:16.117 --> 12:17.117
Is it hot?

12:20.837 --> 12:21.837
Is this delicious?

12:22.197 --> 12:23.237
I'll change it for you.

12:23.427 --> 12:25.187
Watermelon juice? Lemon juice?

12:25.507 --> 12:26.507
Apple juice?

12:27.907 --> 12:28.907
It's okay.

12:30.907 --> 12:32.827
How about a barbecue tomorrow night?

12:33.077 --> 12:34.077
You've been here for days.

12:34.077 --> 12:35.187
But we didn't have a party.

12:36.597 --> 12:37.597
How's that?

12:39.147 --> 12:41.027
We can't talk loudly

12:41.117 --> 12:42.787
after 8:30, right?

12:42.837 --> 12:44.157
Will it disturb the neighbors?

12:44.597 --> 12:45.477
It's nothing.

12:45.477 --> 12:46.667
You won't disturb me.

12:46.837 --> 12:49.397
A party of young people is fine.

12:50.197 --> 12:51.667
So that's it.

12:52.427 --> 12:53.427
Sure.

12:58.077 --> 12:59.077
Aunt.

12:59.317 --> 13:00.213
Yao.

13:00.237 --> 13:01.077
Uncle, done today?

13:01.077 --> 13:01.603
Yes.

13:01.627 --> 13:02.627
Okay.

13:02.837 --> 13:04.293
Please take care of my granny.

13:04.317 --> 13:04.667
Sure.

13:04.667 --> 13:06.003
We'll have a meeting at the stable.

13:06.027 --> 13:06.237
Okay.

13:06.237 --> 13:06.883
Goodbye. Bye.

13:06.907 --> 13:07.883
Goodbye. Bye.

13:07.907 --> 13:08.147
Go.

13:08.147 --> 13:09.147
Bye, aunt.

13:09.427 --> 13:10.427
Go.

13:18.197 --> 13:19.197
Granny.

13:20.547 --> 13:22.397
Does Yao like me?

13:25.837 --> 13:26.837
Joke.

13:27.197 --> 13:28.197
It's a joke.

13:28.387 --> 13:29.517
A joke.

13:44.077 --> 13:45.707
Why isn't Xiaxia home yet?

13:46.547 --> 13:47.403
It should be soon.

13:47.427 --> 13:48.627
It was too late
when he got off the plane last night.

13:48.627 --> 13:49.907
So he went to meet Yuan.

13:50.027 --> 13:52.157
They'll come back together.

13:53.147 --> 13:54.477
Yuan is so naughty...

13:57.507 --> 13:58.547
Eat the eggs.

14:03.077 --> 14:04.077
Coming?

14:05.357 --> 14:06.053
Here you are.

14:06.077 --> 14:07.077
Mom.

14:07.907 --> 14:08.317
Uncle.

14:08.317 --> 14:10.077
What delicious food did you bring me?

14:10.077 --> 14:11.077
You only know to eat food.

14:12.357 --> 14:13.787
You bought so many things.

14:14.547 --> 14:15.547
Sis.

14:16.747 --> 14:18.027
Put them down and eat now.

14:20.357 --> 14:21.643
Uncle, what's this?

14:21.667 --> 14:23.187
Palmier. Take and eat it.

14:27.627 --> 14:28.483
Eat the meal first.

14:28.507 --> 14:30.357
Snacks are after the meal.

14:31.117 --> 14:33.187
She wants it. Just let her eat it.

14:33.477 --> 14:34.213
Hulu.

14:34.237 --> 14:35.877
Go and get your uncle's tableware.

14:41.117 --> 14:42.117
Xiaxia.

14:42.147 --> 14:43.237
I thought you said to go to

14:43.237 --> 14:44.427
a studio in Shanghai

14:44.427 --> 14:45.453
and apply for a job.

14:45.477 --> 14:46.123
Did you go?

14:46.147 --> 14:47.147
Yes.

14:47.197 --> 14:48.667
They said I'm not suitable.

14:48.907 --> 14:49.947
I have to improve my skills.

14:50.427 --> 14:51.667
How about your educational background?

14:52.077 --> 14:53.077
It's fine.

14:53.627 --> 14:55.307
I'll study harder from the master.

14:55.667 --> 14:56.093
Yes.

14:56.117 --> 14:57.477
You're a fresh hand.

14:57.597 --> 14:58.757
Learn more,

14:59.077 --> 15:00.397
and practice more.

15:01.547 --> 15:04.637
Nobody knows if he'll teach you.
His temper is unstable.

15:05.197 --> 15:06.957
Why not?

15:06.957 --> 15:08.187
I'll beg him.

15:10.427 --> 15:11.547
Oh my God.

15:11.547 --> 15:13.237
It's crispy.

15:15.717 --> 15:16.717
Xie Xiaoxia.

15:17.027 --> 15:18.027
You let her watch

15:18.027 --> 15:19.027
those short videos

15:19.027 --> 15:20.093
so she learned it all.

15:20.117 --> 15:21.707
What's that?

15:21.747 --> 15:22.693
I didn't let her watch the short videos.

15:22.717 --> 15:23.717
Don't blame me.

15:23.877 --> 15:25.027
Here, meat sauce.

15:25.477 --> 15:26.997
What Uncle bought is delicious.

15:27.147 --> 15:28.307
Eat it yourself.

15:31.237 --> 15:33.307
How nice you are to your son.

15:40.507 --> 15:40.907
Granny.

15:40.907 --> 15:42.397
I'll do it. Take a break.

15:42.477 --> 15:43.597
I'll do it.

15:43.877 --> 15:46.117
Yuan likes my cooking.

15:47.077 --> 15:48.277
Two more.

15:49.427 --> 15:51.027
Only he wants steamed eggs.

15:51.027 --> 15:52.117
We both eat fried eggs.

15:52.117 --> 15:53.453
Two recipes just for eggs?

15:53.477 --> 15:54.757
You really spoiled him.

15:55.357 --> 15:57.267
He doesn't like egg yolk.

15:57.267 --> 15:58.723
He's growing up.

15:58.747 --> 16:00.357
Growing up? Him?

16:00.477 --> 16:01.507
If he grows taller,

16:01.507 --> 16:02.877
the roof will be poked.

16:03.597 --> 16:04.787
You are biased.

16:05.837 --> 16:07.757
How old is he and how old are you?

16:08.117 --> 16:09.387
When I was his age,

16:09.387 --> 16:10.827
you didn't spoil me at all.

16:10.907 --> 16:13.667
Every day you chased me and beat me.

16:14.267 --> 16:15.883
Once I tried to beat you, you ran away.

16:15.907 --> 16:17.277
How many times could I beat you?

16:17.427 --> 16:19.827
You just favor your little grandson.

16:20.027 --> 16:20.837
Stop.

16:20.837 --> 16:22.547
Give me the dark soy sauce.

16:36.547 --> 16:37.387
When you need salt,

16:37.387 --> 16:38.213
let me put them in.

16:38.237 --> 16:39.523
You put too much of it.

16:39.547 --> 16:40.883
I don't care.

16:40.907 --> 16:41.597
Your grandson

16:41.597 --> 16:42.667
is still growing up.

16:42.667 --> 16:44.427
He can't eat too much salt.

16:45.237 --> 16:47.117
Stop it.

16:47.547 --> 16:48.597
Granny.

16:49.117 --> 16:50.277
Granny.

16:51.547 --> 16:52.293
Honey.

16:52.317 --> 16:53.237
Hug me.

16:53.237 --> 16:54.173
I'm coming, Granny.

16:54.197 --> 16:55.357
I miss you too much, Granny.

16:55.357 --> 16:56.397
Back home?

16:57.357 --> 16:58.357
Let me check.

16:58.877 --> 17:00.157
You cut your hair?

17:01.147 --> 17:02.757
Look energetic.

17:02.757 --> 17:03.907
Of course, Granny.

17:04.147 --> 17:05.147
More handsome.

17:07.117 --> 17:08.317
Granny, what's that?

17:08.557 --> 17:09.333
Smells good.

17:09.357 --> 17:10.387
You'll love it.

17:10.387 --> 17:12.187
All your favorites.

17:12.187 --> 17:13.227
Wash your hands first.

17:13.627 --> 17:14.907
I know. Wash my hands.

17:14.907 --> 17:16.267
You said it all the time.

17:16.987 --> 17:18.507
Granny, hurry up. I'm hungry.

17:20.987 --> 17:22.637
He just knows to eat as soon as he is back.

17:24.467 --> 17:25.667
I bought it for you, Granny.

17:26.037 --> 17:26.923
The waiter said

17:26.947 --> 17:28.813
it's the best for the seniors at your age.

17:28.837 --> 17:30.187
Tencel. Touch it.

17:31.947 --> 17:32.837
It's silky.

17:32.837 --> 17:33.923
Comfortable.

17:33.947 --> 17:34.733
How much is it?

17:34.757 --> 17:35.757
160 yuan.

17:36.147 --> 17:37.467
Too expensive.

17:37.467 --> 17:38.443
Granny, try it on.

17:38.467 --> 17:38.877
Have a try.

17:38.877 --> 17:39.667
It's very good, Granny.

17:39.667 --> 17:40.277
Okay.

17:40.277 --> 17:41.317
Try it.

17:41.517 --> 17:42.277
Try it later.

17:42.277 --> 17:43.277
Eat first.

17:44.227 --> 17:45.203
Sure.

17:45.227 --> 17:46.467
Try it after dinner.

17:46.467 --> 17:47.077
Put it here, Granny.

17:47.077 --> 17:48.077
Okay.

17:57.707 --> 17:58.707
It's for you.

18:01.947 --> 18:03.117
For me?

18:03.947 --> 18:05.277
I know there's a better one.

18:05.277 --> 18:06.013
It's too expensive.

18:06.037 --> 18:07.467
Now it's just a basic product.

18:07.517 --> 18:08.643
When I have money,

18:08.667 --> 18:09.667
I'll buy you a better one.

18:10.317 --> 18:11.883
Don't think of money.

18:11.907 --> 18:13.637
You have to get into the university first.

18:14.757 --> 18:15.757
What?

18:15.837 --> 18:16.707
I sent you a gift,

18:16.707 --> 18:18.267
but you didn't thank me?

18:21.757 --> 18:23.123
Thank you.

18:23.147 --> 18:24.733
I like it very much.

18:24.757 --> 18:25.907
Clever boy.

18:26.427 --> 18:27.093
It's disgusting.

18:27.117 --> 18:28.117
Disgusting.

18:28.277 --> 18:29.277
Eat now.

18:29.907 --> 18:30.923
Listen,

18:30.947 --> 18:32.907
You have to listen to your brother.

18:33.517 --> 18:34.883
Listen to him?

18:34.907 --> 18:35.883
I won't.

18:35.907 --> 18:36.707
I will be better

18:36.707 --> 18:37.877
than you in the future.

18:39.907 --> 18:40.907
Ambitious boy.

18:41.877 --> 18:43.267
Is it ambitious?

18:43.517 --> 18:45.267
It's arrogant.

18:46.077 --> 18:47.387
You can't even find a wife.

18:47.387 --> 18:48.387
How dare you judge me?

18:48.597 --> 18:49.443
When I graduate,

18:49.467 --> 18:50.747
I must get married first.

18:51.227 --> 18:52.733
Granny, look.

18:52.757 --> 18:53.757
He's dreaming now.

18:53.757 --> 18:55.037
Can he find a wife?

18:56.277 --> 18:57.667
How can you say that

18:57.667 --> 18:58.837
to your brother?

18:59.757 --> 19:01.597
Aren't you biased?

19:02.557 --> 19:03.557
Just eat your food.

19:06.987 --> 19:07.947
Eat your eggs.

19:07.947 --> 19:08.883
It's for you.

19:08.907 --> 19:09.907
I know.

19:13.317 --> 19:14.317
Good.

19:14.947 --> 19:15.947
Very good.

19:21.409 --> 19:26.267
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

19:28.724 --> 19:34.007
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

19:35.987 --> 19:42.627
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

19:42.627 --> 19:43.627
Hongdou.

19:43.907 --> 19:44.427
Thank you.

19:44.427 --> 19:46.887
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

19:47.597 --> 19:48.733
Take it.

19:48.757 --> 19:50.357
Come and take it later.

19:50.627 --> 19:51.707
Come on.

19:53.077 --> 19:54.077
Mr. Ma.

19:54.117 --> 19:54.317
Okay.

19:54.317 --> 19:55.707
Come here. Mr. Hu.

19:56.277 --> 19:58.123
It's really good timing for you two.

19:58.147 --> 19:59.837
The meat is just done and you're here.

20:01.467 --> 20:02.467
Thanks.

20:03.147 --> 20:04.147
Where's Xiaxia?

20:04.907 --> 20:05.757
He went to find his master.

20:05.757 --> 20:06.757
Leave him alone.

20:07.187 --> 20:07.357
Right.

20:07.357 --> 20:09.797
Xiaxia brought the specialty from Shanghai.

20:09.837 --> 20:11.163
He can order it online.

20:11.187 --> 20:12.707
It's heavy to bring them back.

20:13.467 --> 20:14.597
Eat while roasting.

20:14.597 --> 20:15.707
Let's eat, everyone.

20:16.117 --> 20:16.517
Come on.

20:16.517 --> 20:17.707
They are ready.

20:17.837 --> 20:18.837
Eat the meat.

20:19.557 --> 20:20.907
Don't get it all over the place.

20:21.037 --> 20:21.987
It's a party.

20:21.987 --> 20:23.747
A party needs a good vibe.

20:27.707 --> 20:28.293
Great.

20:28.317 --> 20:29.427
Who bought the flowers?

20:29.517 --> 20:30.517
Me.

20:30.557 --> 20:31.557
Good taste.

20:32.557 --> 20:35.557
Later, please enjoy my original song.

20:35.557 --> 20:36.837
Lonely Men.

20:37.147 --> 20:38.403
The original song

20:38.427 --> 20:40.797
matches alcohol with friends best.

20:42.907 --> 20:43.707
Come on.

20:43.707 --> 20:44.293
Watch out.

20:44.317 --> 20:45.317
Okay.

20:46.037 --> 20:47.037
To you.

20:47.077 --> 20:47.533
Hongdou.

20:47.557 --> 20:48.293
Thanks.

20:48.317 --> 20:49.317
Use the big one.

20:50.357 --> 20:50.707
We have it.

20:50.707 --> 20:51.443
To your brother.

20:51.467 --> 20:51.907
He can't drink.

20:51.907 --> 20:52.923
He must drink.

20:52.947 --> 20:53.947
Drink this.

20:54.557 --> 20:55.557
We all have drinks?

20:57.597 --> 20:59.157
Cheers.

20:59.427 --> 21:00.427
Wait a minute.

21:00.877 --> 21:01.757
Before we drink,

21:01.757 --> 21:03.363
we have to propose a toast.

21:03.387 --> 21:04.387
From me.

21:04.557 --> 21:06.467
To all of you,

21:06.597 --> 21:09.053
live a healthy and safe life.

21:09.077 --> 21:09.493
Okay?

21:09.517 --> 21:10.493
Good.

21:10.517 --> 21:11.747
To us,

21:11.837 --> 21:13.397
be friends forever.

21:14.227 --> 21:15.877
I wish you happiness every day.

21:17.837 --> 21:20.187
I will ride the wind and break the waves

21:20.557 --> 21:23.467
and hoist the sails to travel in the vast sea.

21:24.427 --> 21:26.877
Wish us a big fortune.

21:27.357 --> 21:28.637
All wishes can come true.

21:28.707 --> 21:29.643
Come on.

21:29.667 --> 21:31.397
Wish our motherland prosperous.

21:31.947 --> 21:33.157
Best of today.

21:33.227 --> 21:34.013
One more for reward.

21:34.037 --> 21:34.533
Sure.

21:34.557 --> 21:37.267
Wish a prosperous motherland.

21:37.787 --> 21:39.767
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

21:39.767 --> 21:42.187
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

21:42.187 --> 21:43.667
Why is this champagne so sweet?

21:43.707 --> 21:44.573
What's wrong?

21:44.597 --> 21:45.117
It's awful.

21:45.117 --> 21:49.397
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

21:49.427 --> 21:50.517
You're used to drinking tea.

21:50.517 --> 21:51.667
So you can't drink champagne?

21:51.667 --> 21:58.947
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫

22:27.877 --> 22:28.877
Master.

22:38.517 --> 22:39.797
You're back.

22:43.077 --> 22:44.187
It's a gift for you.

22:52.467 --> 22:53.467
Master.

22:54.627 --> 22:55.797
What else?

22:58.627 --> 23:00.187
I'm not going to work in Shanghai.

23:00.907 --> 23:01.877
I have to practice more

23:01.877 --> 23:02.877
and learn from you.

23:07.877 --> 23:09.427
Master, did you hear me?

23:11.907 --> 23:13.267
I'm not deaf.

23:33.667 --> 23:34.837
What are you doing here?

23:34.907 --> 23:35.227
Master.

23:35.227 --> 23:36.517
You always blame me for my inconsideration.

23:36.517 --> 23:37.837
I'll sweep the floor.

23:37.837 --> 23:38.947
Master, lift your feet.

23:41.117 --> 23:42.117
That's enough.

23:42.597 --> 23:43.597
Go away.

23:44.877 --> 23:46.277
Master, kick me more to let out your anger.

23:46.277 --> 23:47.277
Master.

23:53.627 --> 23:54.877
I was wrong.

23:56.147 --> 23:57.427
I'll listen to you.

23:58.227 --> 23:59.403
I won't play games

23:59.427 --> 24:00.427
nor do online broadcasting.

24:02.147 --> 24:03.187
Do you still want me as your disciple?

24:08.667 --> 24:10.797
You call me Master, Master.

24:11.667 --> 24:12.707
What did I say?

24:15.147 --> 24:19.267
Don't... pretend to work.

24:19.837 --> 24:21.013
You will think of other things

24:21.037 --> 24:22.427
in a few days.

24:25.387 --> 24:26.427
Settle down.

24:27.037 --> 24:28.157
Yes, Master.

24:28.707 --> 24:30.093
You scared me.

24:30.117 --> 24:30.667
Go.

24:30.667 --> 24:31.533
Do your job.

24:31.557 --> 24:32.557
Go.

24:32.707 --> 24:33.987
Do you want Palmier?

24:34.037 --> 24:35.037
No.

24:35.357 --> 24:36.637
Do you know what it is?

24:36.907 --> 24:37.907
No.

24:39.357 --> 24:40.557
A Shanghai specialty.

24:40.757 --> 24:41.757
I don't want to eat it.

24:41.757 --> 24:42.333
You...

24:42.357 --> 24:43.123
Go away.

24:43.147 --> 24:44.157
It's delicious.

24:47.757 --> 24:48.757
What?

24:48.877 --> 24:49.403
I just...

24:49.427 --> 24:50.837
Have a try.

24:53.947 --> 24:54.947
Good?

24:55.987 --> 24:57.157
Well. It's delicious.

25:09.597 --> 25:10.877
When I was in high school,

25:11.037 --> 25:13.037
I wrote a love letter to a girl.

25:13.837 --> 25:14.837
But she...

25:15.037 --> 25:16.267
She told our teacher,

25:16.667 --> 25:18.333
and said I disturbed her studies.

25:18.357 --> 25:19.883
The teacher was our class adviser.

25:19.907 --> 25:21.837
And the advisor taught us Chinese.

25:22.147 --> 25:25.877
So she read my letter in the classroom.

25:26.117 --> 25:28.467
She criticized that I had a poor choice of words

25:28.557 --> 25:30.037
and many grammar mistakes,

25:30.147 --> 25:32.947
and my love is a kind of superficial love.

25:33.707 --> 25:34.963
So she told your parents?

25:34.987 --> 25:36.837
Yes. My dad came to school.

25:36.987 --> 25:39.293
But my dad didn't take it seriously.

25:39.317 --> 25:40.557
I always made trouble,

25:41.597 --> 25:41.947
so he...

25:41.947 --> 25:43.203
He just reminded me of one thing,

25:43.227 --> 25:44.123
and said,

25:44.147 --> 25:45.157
from now on,

25:45.467 --> 25:47.013
if you want to write a love letter,

25:47.037 --> 25:47.357
first,

25:47.357 --> 25:49.507
you should have the confidence to win her heart,

25:49.557 --> 25:50.557
or in the end,

25:50.667 --> 25:51.557
you, you, you...

25:51.557 --> 25:52.747
You'll lose your face.

25:54.667 --> 25:56.037
Your father has experience.

25:59.387 --> 26:00.837
Speaking of silly things,

26:01.037 --> 26:02.117
I have a story to tell.

26:02.627 --> 26:04.643
When I was in high school,

26:04.667 --> 26:05.837
for one period,

26:05.837 --> 26:06.837
I worked so hard

26:06.837 --> 26:08.227
and did test papers every day.

26:09.317 --> 26:10.467
When I took a break one day,

26:10.667 --> 26:12.037
I stood up suddenly.

26:14.227 --> 26:15.397
I felt my hemorrhoid burst.

26:16.627 --> 26:17.627
Oh, my god.

26:19.037 --> 26:20.157
Even today,

26:21.317 --> 26:21.987
I still remember

26:21.987 --> 26:25.117
how the girl next to me looked at me.

26:25.667 --> 26:26.733
My god.

26:26.757 --> 26:28.667
She actually liked me...

26:30.557 --> 26:32.157
You should listen to my story.

26:32.427 --> 26:33.627
When I was in high school

26:33.627 --> 26:34.947
one day I left the toilet,

26:34.947 --> 26:37.037
but my dress was stuck in my underwear.

26:37.877 --> 26:38.963
So everyone could see my ass

26:38.987 --> 26:40.877
all the way from the toilet to the classroom.

26:41.667 --> 26:43.163
No one told you about it?

26:43.187 --> 26:44.947
They're busy watching me.

26:45.037 --> 26:46.907
I thought it was because of my beauty,

26:46.907 --> 26:48.187
so I was so excited.

26:50.037 --> 26:52.093
Didn't you change to a new school?

26:52.117 --> 26:53.117
No.

26:53.877 --> 26:55.117
Didn't they laugh at you?

26:55.187 --> 26:56.277
They did.

26:56.277 --> 26:57.077
So many students went

26:57.077 --> 26:58.557
to look at me at the door.

26:59.427 --> 27:01.093
I pretended that I didn't care

27:01.117 --> 27:03.037
like nothing ever happened.

27:03.147 --> 27:04.557
Or what else could I do?

27:05.187 --> 27:06.597
Then, what happened next?

27:07.467 --> 27:09.363
I didn't remember it.

27:09.387 --> 27:10.597
I just forgot about it.

27:13.877 --> 27:14.877
To be honest,

27:15.037 --> 27:16.597
it's called the spotlight effect.

27:16.947 --> 27:17.557
You always think

27:17.557 --> 27:18.667
you're being noticed.

27:18.707 --> 27:20.187
But no one is watching you.

27:20.557 --> 27:21.797
No matter how serious it is,

27:21.877 --> 27:23.187
you will forget it days later.

27:24.837 --> 27:26.507
So many things happen every day,

27:27.147 --> 27:28.397
you can't remember them all.

27:28.667 --> 27:29.747
No, you can't.

27:32.037 --> 27:34.037
When you're my age,

27:34.187 --> 27:35.267
you will understand

27:35.757 --> 27:37.227
that in your life,

27:37.227 --> 27:39.387
you will feel happy and lucky that

27:39.387 --> 27:41.187
you only face silly things of this level.

27:42.947 --> 27:43.947
You know,

27:43.947 --> 27:45.227
when I was in university,

27:45.227 --> 27:46.597
I fell in love with music.

27:46.597 --> 27:47.947
So I joined a band.

27:48.317 --> 27:49.387
After graduation,

27:49.387 --> 27:50.757
I didn't hunt for a job

27:50.757 --> 27:52.267
but practiced with the band.

27:52.757 --> 27:53.757
The result was

27:54.427 --> 27:55.467
my dad was so mad

27:56.277 --> 27:57.277
then he got stoke.

27:58.187 --> 27:59.187
Till now,

28:00.037 --> 28:01.117
with just one of his legs,

28:01.277 --> 28:02.507
he can't walk well.

28:07.117 --> 28:08.187
I am so regretful.

28:08.987 --> 28:10.317
I'm too ashamed to go back home.

28:17.077 --> 28:18.077
Yes.

28:20.357 --> 28:21.637
There are so many people,

28:23.147 --> 28:24.837
we see them building up,

28:25.757 --> 28:27.507
we see them sharing his glory,

28:29.947 --> 28:31.507
we also see them breaking down.

28:45.147 --> 28:46.147
Yuan.

28:47.277 --> 28:48.907
Do you know your brother

28:48.907 --> 28:52.187
support Xiaochun studying in university?

28:52.357 --> 28:53.357
I know.

28:53.837 --> 28:54.907
Aunt Baoping says it every day.

28:54.907 --> 28:55.907
Everyone knows it.

28:57.357 --> 28:58.147
Everyone knows it?

28:58.147 --> 28:59.427
We don't know it.

29:00.907 --> 29:02.907
My family was poor.

29:03.317 --> 29:04.797
We have no money for tuition fees.

29:05.557 --> 29:06.747
My mom,

29:08.357 --> 29:10.467
went to borrow money door to door.

29:11.077 --> 29:12.357
I thought at that time,

29:13.317 --> 29:14.507
Well, I should give it up

29:16.277 --> 29:17.837
and go to work and make money.

29:18.947 --> 29:19.947
Because my mom

29:19.947 --> 29:21.427
had to feed two kids by herself.

29:21.427 --> 29:23.363
We have to study and eat,

29:23.387 --> 29:26.427
so it all depends on my mom.

29:28.667 --> 29:30.227
It's tough for her.

29:31.837 --> 29:32.837
Yao, here's tea.

29:36.317 --> 29:37.467
Xiaochun.

29:37.947 --> 29:39.747
Your mom called me and said

29:40.147 --> 29:42.427
you wanted to work and gave up studying.

29:47.227 --> 29:50.707
Honghong said the garment factory is recruiting.

29:50.757 --> 29:51.357
So if I work there,

29:51.357 --> 29:52.467
I can trim threads.

29:53.877 --> 29:55.117
Do you want to keep studying?

30:01.357 --> 30:03.557
It's not up to what I think.

30:04.277 --> 30:06.317
You know how poor my family is.

30:07.117 --> 30:07.813
Everything is all

30:07.837 --> 30:09.597
depending on my mom.

30:13.667 --> 30:14.907
No matter what I can do,

30:18.557 --> 30:19.637
I can't...

30:20.877 --> 30:22.187
keep studying in school.

30:26.557 --> 30:27.597
Don't think of money,

30:28.667 --> 30:30.317
tell me how you actually feel.

30:31.317 --> 30:33.117
Do you want to study in school?

30:45.317 --> 30:46.317
Aunt Baoping.

30:47.277 --> 30:48.467
Though I just started working,

30:48.467 --> 30:49.467
and I'm not highly paid now,

30:50.277 --> 30:53.187
but I can... cover her tuition fees.

30:55.117 --> 30:56.507
Xiaochun is still young

30:57.357 --> 30:58.597
so she needs to study more.

31:01.037 --> 31:02.037
Xiaochun.

31:02.517 --> 31:03.877
It's not a waste of time to study.

31:05.117 --> 31:07.947
Knowledge is the bridge to the world.

31:17.627 --> 31:18.667
At that time,

31:19.837 --> 31:21.117
Yao came back from Beijing

31:21.117 --> 31:22.117
to see me,

31:23.037 --> 31:24.187
and told me,

31:25.357 --> 31:26.637
It's not a waste to study.

31:27.077 --> 31:29.947
Knowledge is the bridge to the world.

31:35.387 --> 31:36.707
You said it exactly.

31:37.557 --> 31:38.733
Next.

31:38.757 --> 31:40.077
Talk about something else.

31:40.987 --> 31:42.597
You know, President Xie.

31:42.667 --> 31:44.443
If you tell him off in person,

31:44.467 --> 31:45.683
he has a thick skin

31:45.707 --> 31:46.747
so he feels nothing.

31:47.077 --> 31:48.923
But if you praise him in person,

31:48.947 --> 31:50.467
I'd say you'd better diss him

31:53.357 --> 31:55.187
So I am thinking to establish

31:55.187 --> 31:57.837
a global fan club for Xie Zhiyao.

31:57.947 --> 31:58.757
I'm the club manager.

31:58.757 --> 31:59.837
I am the deputy manager.

31:59.837 --> 32:00.123
What?

32:00.147 --> 32:01.507
Why do you get so excited?

32:02.947 --> 32:04.147
Do you have the admission fee?

32:04.147 --> 32:05.533
No entry fee.

32:05.557 --> 32:07.267
The idol will eat with you.

32:08.147 --> 32:09.013
Well. I'm in

32:09.037 --> 32:10.037
You should join.

32:12.877 --> 32:13.517
Join us.

32:13.517 --> 32:14.517
Sure.

32:20.947 --> 32:22.707
Mr. Ma. The tea tastes great.

32:23.117 --> 32:24.117
You have good taste.

32:24.987 --> 32:27.987
The problem is that...
you want to pee easily.

32:31.557 --> 32:32.533
Where are you going?

32:32.557 --> 32:33.403
Toilet.

32:33.427 --> 32:34.427
What? You wanna join?

32:34.597 --> 32:36.157
My turn, first.

32:36.317 --> 32:36.733
Go, go.

32:36.757 --> 32:37.797
It's my turn.

32:40.117 --> 32:41.363
If you drink too much,

32:41.387 --> 32:42.837
you can't sleep at night.

32:43.907 --> 32:46.227
Cafe and tea won't work for me.

32:46.317 --> 32:47.147
I used to stay up,

32:47.147 --> 32:48.707
so I've drunk a lot to stay awake.

32:49.707 --> 32:50.643
You should worry that

32:50.667 --> 32:52.227
you have to go to the toilet at night.

32:53.117 --> 32:54.557
I am the second runner-up in my hotel

32:54.557 --> 32:55.317
in holding the urine.

32:55.317 --> 32:57.467
The winner was a 22-year-old girl.

32:58.227 --> 32:59.707
Are you competing for it?

33:00.317 --> 33:01.507
Just for fun.

33:01.627 --> 33:02.947
What is it for?

33:03.757 --> 33:04.797
Seek joy, as life is hard.

33:08.557 --> 33:10.357
Yuan is about to go back.

33:10.627 --> 33:12.637
Who on earth told the secret to others?

33:12.667 --> 33:13.747
A case without any clue?

33:15.707 --> 33:16.707
Do you want to know it?

33:17.837 --> 33:18.837
Come here.

33:21.117 --> 33:22.117
Closer.

33:31.947 --> 33:33.117
Rather die?

33:33.187 --> 33:34.187
You just got the runs

33:34.187 --> 33:35.267
and pooped in your pants.

33:35.837 --> 33:36.683
Xie Zhiyao.

33:36.707 --> 33:39.357
If you repeat it, again, I'll go to die.

33:39.517 --> 33:41.317
Go to die after you graduate.

33:48.387 --> 33:50.707
Uncle Yuan didn't go to school,

33:50.757 --> 33:52.877
because he pooed in his pants.

33:54.117 --> 33:55.317
Let's go now.

33:55.837 --> 33:57.053
You can't go. Stay here.

33:57.077 --> 33:58.467
What are you doing? Xie Zhiyuan.

33:58.557 --> 33:59.533
Leave us.

33:59.557 --> 34:01.093
I won't. I won't.

34:01.117 --> 34:02.133
I'm not leaving.

34:02.157 --> 34:03.957
Are you alright? Did you hurt yourself?

34:07.357 --> 34:09.157
A bunch of bad kids.

34:09.277 --> 34:10.237
During that period,

34:10.237 --> 34:12.213
Lil Cute often got the runs.

34:12.237 --> 34:13.477
I felt it weird.

34:26.547 --> 34:26.717
Wait.

34:26.717 --> 34:28.387
What secret are you talking about?

34:30.357 --> 34:31.557
I won't tell you.

34:33.387 --> 34:36.043
Implement the strategy of rural vitalization.

34:36.067 --> 34:38.067
Stick to our Party to manage the village.

34:38.067 --> 34:38.677
What do you buy?

34:38.677 --> 34:39.797
Some vegetables and fish.

34:39.797 --> 34:40.907
Come to have dinner another day?

34:40.907 --> 34:41.613
Sure.

34:41.637 --> 34:42.827
Uncle, paint the characters?

34:43.067 --> 34:43.637
Yes, Xiaxia.

34:43.637 --> 34:45.637
Stick to peasant Subjectivity.

34:45.837 --> 34:48.957
Step up rural vitalization.

34:49.587 --> 34:52.477
Insist on integrated urban-rural development.

34:52.757 --> 34:54.587
Ensure harmony between man and nature.

34:54.587 --> 34:55.637
Xinxin.

34:56.107 --> 34:57.117
Xiaxia.

34:57.357 --> 34:58.133
Uncle.

34:58.157 --> 35:00.117
You need to see Xinxin?

35:00.277 --> 35:02.347
My brother asked me to come to help.

35:02.757 --> 35:03.507
She was here earlier.

35:03.507 --> 35:04.597
I'll call her.

35:06.587 --> 35:07.197
She's coming.

35:07.197 --> 35:08.427
You came fast. Xiaxia.

35:08.427 --> 35:09.427
Xinxin.

35:09.837 --> 35:10.427
What can I do?

35:10.427 --> 35:11.133
Let me take care of it.

35:11.157 --> 35:11.883
Here.

35:11.907 --> 35:13.957
We'll hand them out door to door.

35:14.387 --> 35:15.027
The front side

35:15.027 --> 35:16.317
introduces tricks of fraud.

35:16.317 --> 35:18.107
On the reverse side are examples.
[How to deal with telecom fraud]

35:18.107 --> 35:19.963
We will hand them out door to door.

35:19.987 --> 35:22.587
If the seniors can't speak Mandarin well,

35:22.587 --> 35:24.117
please interpret what we say.

35:25.237 --> 35:26.517
Why do we do it suddenly?

35:26.677 --> 35:28.837
We have introduced precautions
against trap loans.

35:28.837 --> 35:29.957
It helped them a lot.

35:29.987 --> 35:30.757
So these days,

35:30.757 --> 35:32.067
Mr. Xie said we could do the publicity

35:32.067 --> 35:33.387
about telecom fraud

35:33.757 --> 35:36.443
I haven't heard of any victims in our village,

35:36.467 --> 35:37.237
but it's never too late

35:37.237 --> 35:38.347
to take precautions.

35:42.107 --> 35:42.733
Aunt E.

35:42.757 --> 35:45.213
There have been many cases
of telecom fraud recently.

35:45.237 --> 35:47.037
People of your age are targeted.

35:47.157 --> 35:48.883
If you answer a phone call,

35:48.907 --> 35:50.477
saying your grandson is kidnapped

35:50.547 --> 35:52.597
or your son is arrested
by police for prostitution.

35:52.987 --> 35:54.957
Guanjun will never do bad things.

35:55.987 --> 35:57.003
Just for an example.

35:57.027 --> 35:57.333
Yes.

35:57.357 --> 35:59.117
I just took it as an example.

35:59.157 --> 36:01.963
The criminal has different excuses to scare you.

36:01.987 --> 36:02.907
The only purpose

36:02.907 --> 36:04.597
is to make you give them money.

36:04.717 --> 36:05.637
If you don't transfer money,

36:05.637 --> 36:06.667
you won't be a victim.

36:06.877 --> 36:07.733
I got it.

36:07.757 --> 36:08.293
Really?

36:08.317 --> 36:09.597
Don't transfer money.

36:10.547 --> 36:11.883
Come on. Xinxin. Here's the water.

36:11.907 --> 36:12.237
No, thanks.

36:12.237 --> 36:13.237
I have it in my bag.

36:13.547 --> 36:13.907
Chuchu.

36:13.907 --> 36:14.363
For you.

36:14.387 --> 36:14.907
Thank you.

36:14.907 --> 36:15.693
Here you are.

36:15.717 --> 36:17.597
Tell your families to
know more about phone fraud.

36:17.757 --> 36:18.757
Okay.

36:19.027 --> 36:20.733
But we know it is a trick immediately,

36:20.757 --> 36:22.363
why were so many people tricked?

36:22.387 --> 36:23.427
It is unbelievable.

36:23.427 --> 36:24.477
It's common.

36:24.677 --> 36:26.707
What we should remember is,

36:26.987 --> 36:27.637
no matter who calls,

36:27.637 --> 36:29.157
take care of the money in your wallet.

36:29.157 --> 36:30.507
However sweet it sounds, don't trust them.

36:30.507 --> 36:31.557
They must be liars.

36:31.987 --> 36:33.347
Aunt Baoping is right.

36:34.317 --> 36:36.187
Many people are obsessed.

36:37.837 --> 36:39.477
Also, they got a witchier way to cheat.

36:40.197 --> 36:41.437
Be your friend first.

36:41.837 --> 36:43.267
After you drop your guard,

36:43.317 --> 36:45.213
they'll ask you to buy funds,

36:45.237 --> 36:46.387
trade futures for money.

36:46.467 --> 36:48.157
It's obviously a liar.

36:48.237 --> 36:49.347
But it is your friend.

36:49.387 --> 36:50.813
Isn't it silly?

36:50.837 --> 36:52.067
Is there anyone making money

36:52.067 --> 36:52.987
not for themselves

36:52.987 --> 36:55.227
but for others meeting online?

36:55.757 --> 36:56.947
This is what we call

36:56.947 --> 36:58.067
a kind of romance scam

36:58.067 --> 36:59.043
in our pamphlet.

36:59.067 --> 36:59.853
Listen.

36:59.877 --> 37:02.477
Care about you online and get your love.

37:02.507 --> 37:05.043
After you completely trust them,

37:05.067 --> 37:06.923
then they will borrow a large amount of money

37:06.947 --> 37:08.837
by using excuses like starting up together,

37:08.837 --> 37:10.563
or families are sick.

37:10.587 --> 37:12.507
Or they pretend they have internal information

37:12.507 --> 37:14.597
of profitable funds or futures,

37:14.637 --> 37:16.317
and send you phishing sites

37:16.317 --> 37:17.437
to get your money.

37:17.757 --> 37:18.357
Some criminals

37:18.357 --> 37:21.517
will pretend to be an authorized seller.

37:22.837 --> 37:23.733
Xiaxia.

37:23.757 --> 37:24.827
Still in cyber romance?

37:28.907 --> 37:31.187
She can't be trusted
if you don't know her background.

37:31.277 --> 37:32.667
Xiaxia is in a relationship?

37:33.027 --> 37:34.037
No, I'm not.

37:35.317 --> 37:36.667
He is not popular at all.

37:37.317 --> 37:38.317
Well.

37:38.357 --> 37:40.003
Remember what I said.

37:40.027 --> 37:41.707
Don't transfer your money.

37:41.877 --> 37:42.363
Sure.

37:42.387 --> 37:43.403
Don't forget it.

37:43.427 --> 37:45.003
Well. Enjoy the dishes.

37:45.027 --> 37:46.693
We will go on passing out leaflets.

37:46.717 --> 37:47.483
Let's go.

37:47.507 --> 37:48.517
It's hard work.

37:48.677 --> 37:49.133
See you.

37:49.157 --> 37:50.253
See you, Xinxin.

37:50.277 --> 37:51.277
Bye, bye.

37:51.637 --> 37:52.747
Drink more water.

38:37.027 --> 38:38.027
A long way to go.

38:39.637 --> 38:40.637
Don't give up.

38:40.877 --> 38:41.877
Come on.

38:42.277 --> 38:43.277
Let's go.

38:54.237 --> 38:54.637
Excuse me,

38:54.637 --> 38:56.187
clean up here, please.

39:01.107 --> 39:02.347
Hello, President Chen.

39:03.107 --> 39:03.653
Yes.

39:03.677 --> 39:04.277
I am sorry.

39:04.277 --> 39:05.173
Are you okay?

39:05.197 --> 39:06.237
Please, prepare a new cup of it.

39:06.237 --> 39:06.757
Sure thing.

39:06.757 --> 39:07.757
Sorry.

39:08.637 --> 39:08.877
Yes.

39:08.877 --> 39:10.347
I'm focusing on this plan.

39:11.987 --> 39:12.987
Nana.

39:13.357 --> 39:14.693
A cup of Passion Tea, hurry.

39:14.717 --> 39:15.717
Got it.

39:17.947 --> 39:18.947
It's busy now.

39:19.837 --> 39:20.917
Here you are.

39:21.107 --> 39:22.107
Just walk around.

39:23.197 --> 39:24.437
A cup of Encounter Tea.

39:25.237 --> 39:26.237
Thanks.

39:30.907 --> 39:31.997
Granny Xiuying.

39:32.837 --> 39:34.293
Sweep away fallen leaves at the entrance.

39:34.317 --> 39:35.317
No, I don't.

39:35.637 --> 39:36.867
Why not?

39:37.107 --> 39:38.387
The entrance is not my place.

39:38.637 --> 39:39.707
I won't help her.

39:40.027 --> 39:41.157
What's going on?

39:41.507 --> 39:42.867
Did you quarrel?

39:50.317 --> 39:51.317
Yesterday,

39:51.357 --> 39:53.333
my nephew took her children to see me,

39:53.357 --> 39:54.883
so I left a bit earlier,

39:54.907 --> 39:56.403
and asked her to clean the toilet.

39:56.427 --> 39:58.187
And she said she'd do it.

39:58.317 --> 39:59.317
But she didn't.

39:59.357 --> 40:00.813
Every time she went back home,

40:00.837 --> 40:02.037
I'd clean it for her.

40:02.637 --> 40:03.997
I just forgot about it.

40:05.107 --> 40:06.043
You...

40:06.067 --> 40:07.067
When you were 20 years old,

40:07.067 --> 40:08.213
you were the same.

40:08.237 --> 40:09.317
As your family harvested rice,

40:09.317 --> 40:10.363
I went to help you.

40:10.387 --> 40:11.613
When my family picked beans,

40:11.637 --> 40:12.107
and you?

40:12.107 --> 40:13.747
You went to the town to sing.

40:14.027 --> 40:15.027
You are so lazy.

40:15.547 --> 40:16.787
It was years ago.

40:17.467 --> 40:18.827
You're narrow-minded in your life.

40:20.317 --> 40:21.707
Yao, do me justice.

40:24.237 --> 40:25.317
Granny Xiuying,

40:25.317 --> 40:26.437
is not narrow-minded.

40:27.027 --> 40:28.867
Granny Caiyun is not lazy.

40:29.067 --> 40:30.213
She forgot it.

40:30.237 --> 40:31.867
She will do it if she makes her promise.

40:32.387 --> 40:34.707
I cleaned it this morning.

40:35.277 --> 40:36.587
When I arrived this morning,

40:36.587 --> 40:38.347
she had almost finished it.

40:39.107 --> 40:40.707
I did forget it.

40:41.067 --> 40:41.923
I think so.

40:41.947 --> 40:43.707
It's true Granny Caiyun forgot it.

40:43.987 --> 40:45.883
She often cleaned one of the shelves

40:45.907 --> 40:47.067
for twice,

40:47.067 --> 40:47.877
forgot the other shelf.

40:47.877 --> 40:48.877
Right?

40:51.757 --> 40:53.173
Once you twisted your ankle,

40:53.197 --> 40:53.987
isn't it Granny Caiyun

40:53.987 --> 40:55.597
that brought dishes to you every day?

40:56.387 --> 40:57.867
That's what I should do.

40:57.907 --> 40:58.613
It's alright.

40:58.637 --> 40:59.997
Sure, that's what you should do.

41:00.157 --> 41:01.443
You are good friends.

41:01.467 --> 41:02.813
Best girlfriends for years.

41:02.837 --> 41:04.667
Your friendship is deep. You'll help each other.

41:05.107 --> 41:06.107
Yes.

41:06.237 --> 41:07.387
I am too selfish.

41:08.637 --> 41:09.997
You are not selfish.

41:10.197 --> 41:11.083
When I was a kid,

41:11.107 --> 41:12.107
you always invited me

41:12.107 --> 41:14.293
to try the delicious food you cooked, right?

41:14.317 --> 41:15.437
You're generous.

41:17.587 --> 41:18.443
Well, fine.

41:18.467 --> 41:19.517
It's no big deal.

41:20.877 --> 41:22.517
I apologize.

41:22.717 --> 41:23.827
I am sorry.

41:24.387 --> 41:25.027
Caiyun.

41:25.027 --> 41:26.187
I said it's fine.

41:26.387 --> 41:27.547
I know you are getting older,

41:27.547 --> 41:29.037
and your memory is getting worse.

41:32.467 --> 41:33.867
It's good to hear that.

41:34.277 --> 41:35.437
Time to work.

41:35.547 --> 41:36.253
Granny Caiyun.

41:36.277 --> 41:38.317
The entrance is in your charge,

41:38.317 --> 41:39.787
please sweep the fallen leaves.

41:41.357 --> 41:42.277
If she sweeps now,

41:42.277 --> 41:43.597
the leaves will fall again.

41:43.907 --> 41:44.757
We'll take a break,

41:44.757 --> 41:45.693
and drink water.

41:45.717 --> 41:46.717
Go.

41:53.277 --> 41:54.277
She is right.

41:54.907 --> 41:55.907
It makes sense.

41:58.987 --> 41:59.987
Is it over?

42:00.427 --> 42:01.597
It's done.

42:02.387 --> 42:03.827
It happens to them all the time.

42:03.907 --> 42:06.317
They quarrel over trivial things.

42:06.317 --> 42:07.437
And there'll be no end.

42:07.717 --> 42:08.547
When they are in peace,

42:08.547 --> 42:10.267
they're like real sisters.

42:10.467 --> 42:11.507
If they're quarreling,

42:11.507 --> 42:13.597
even things happening years ago
will be brought up.

42:14.317 --> 42:15.027
I thought

42:15.027 --> 42:17.267
best girlfriends won't quarrel
if they get older.

42:17.837 --> 42:19.827
They have time to quarrel
only until they get older.

42:25.237 --> 42:27.637
Have you talked to Xu Hongdou about working here?

42:27.837 --> 42:28.653
Sure I have.

42:28.677 --> 42:29.677
She said no.

42:30.587 --> 42:32.477
But she came to help me sometimes.

42:33.907 --> 42:34.813
It's kind of her.

42:34.837 --> 42:35.837
Yes.

42:36.107 --> 42:37.107
Mr. Xie.

42:37.157 --> 42:38.597
Can we just give her up?

42:38.677 --> 42:40.787
We can pay someone else to work as a waitress.

42:41.317 --> 42:43.117
I didn't want her to be a waitress.

42:44.637 --> 42:46.347
So you want her to stay here?

42:48.107 --> 42:49.443
It's impossible.

42:49.467 --> 42:52.787
She won't stay here to be a staff like me.

42:54.507 --> 42:55.997
I didn't mean it.

42:56.107 --> 42:57.437
I know she'll leave us.

42:58.387 --> 42:59.557
So what did you mean?

43:00.357 --> 43:01.637
Use her remaining energy.

43:01.947 --> 43:02.813
As I see,

43:02.837 --> 43:03.757
her working style

43:03.757 --> 43:04.957
is different from yours.

43:05.237 --> 43:07.707
You will unconsciously follow what she said.

43:07.837 --> 43:10.557
The customers feel comfortable with her service.

43:11.067 --> 43:13.917
This is the charm of professionalism.

43:17.317 --> 43:19.307
But it didn't work though I asked her.

43:19.987 --> 43:20.837
It's your decision.

43:20.837 --> 43:22.187
I feel it's impossible.

43:22.757 --> 43:23.867
Don't worry.

43:23.947 --> 43:26.347
I will take the field.

43:30.607 --> 43:36.087
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

43:38.047 --> 43:43.007
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

43:45.447 --> 43:51.527
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

43:51.847 --> 43:57.207
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

44:00.167 --> 44:05.567
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

44:07.527 --> 44:12.407
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

44:14.967 --> 44:21.167
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

44:21.487 --> 44:27.687
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

44:29.767 --> 44:36.087
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

44:36.207 --> 44:42.967
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

44:44.367 --> 44:46.383
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

44:46.407 --> 44:50.807
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

44:51.047 --> 44:58.247
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

